:: MP Region Pool Router [nobr]
<<set _curDay to ((window.Time and Time.days) or 0)>><<if $mpSeenScenesDay isnot _curDay>><<set $mpSeenScenes to {}>><<set $mpSeenScenesDay to _curDay>><<else>><<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><</if>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set _reg to ($mpCurrentRegion or "Foghorn")>>
<<include ("MP Region Pool " + _reg)>>


:: MP Region Pool Foghorn [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpFogChainDone to ($mpFogChainDone or {})>>
<<set _mpFogDay to ((window.Time and Time.days) or 0)>><<if $mpFogLamp is undefined>><<set $mpFogLamp to 2>><</if>><<if $mpFogLamp lte 0 and $mpFogOilDay isnot _mpFogDay>><<set $mpFogLamp to 1>><<set $mpFogOilDay to _mpFogDay>><</if>><<set $mpFogLamp to Math.clamp($mpFogLamp, 0, 5)>>
<<set $mpFogAlert to Math.clamp(($mpFogAlert or 0), 0, 10)>><<set $mpFogDepth to Math.clamp(($mpFogDepth or 0), 0, 3)>>
海雾裹着咸腥的浪沫漫过雾角礁盘，灯塔底座与栈桥在灰白水汽中若隐若现。<<if $mpFogLamp lte 0>>手里的防风灯已经断油，暗处危机四伏。<<else>>防风灯里尚有余油，火苗在雾中透出暖黄微光。<</if>><<if $mpFogAlert gte 6>>岸阶旁晃动着巡逻灯影，稽查正盘问过往行迹。<<elseif $mpFogDepth gte 2>>你这一趟已走入雾角深处，潮水正漫上退路。<</if>><<if $mpFogChainDone["pier"] and $mpFogChainDone["wreck"] and $mpFogChainDone["tower"] and $mpFogChainDone["echo"]>>栈桥、外礁、灯塔与回音廊都已探过，只余海风拍岸的余波。<<else>>近处栈桥通向守塔旧居，退潮外礁则露出了商船残骸。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回雾角岛 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[探栈桥旧居 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Pier Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Foghorn Pier Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpboaticon>><<link [[涉水去沉船外礁 (0:07)|MP Region Foghorn Wreck Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Foghorn Wreck Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpFogChainDone["tower"]>>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[攀登灯塔旋梯 (0:08)|MP Region Foghorn Tower Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpFogLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpFogLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Foghorn Tower Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[寻回音廊守塔遗物 (0:08)|MP Region Foghorn Echo Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpFogLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpFogLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Foghorn Echo Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Pool Clockwork [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpClockChainDone to ($mpClockChainDone or {})>>
<<set _mpClockDay to ((window.Time and Time.days) or 0)>><<if $mpClockLamp is undefined>><<set $mpClockLamp to 2>><</if>><<if $mpClockLamp lte 0 and $mpClockOilDay isnot _mpClockDay>><<set $mpClockLamp to 1>><<set $mpClockOilDay to _mpClockDay>><</if>><<set $mpClockLamp to Math.clamp($mpClockLamp, 0, 5)>>
<<set $mpClockAlert to Math.clamp(($mpClockAlert or 0), 0, 10)>><<set $mpClockDepth to Math.clamp(($mpClockDepth or 0), 0, 3)>>
温热油雾漫过地下机括城的铸铁格栅，主擒纵轮与蒸汽铜管在幽暗拱顶下发出规律的咬合低鸣。<<if $mpClockLamp lte 0>>手里的防风提灯已经断油，齿轮阴影里危机四伏。<<else>>提灯里尚有余油，暖黄光晕照亮了脚下的排油槽。<</if>><<if $mpClockAlert gte 6>>上层回廊传来扳手敲击铜管的巡检警讯，机匠正盘查异响来源。<<elseif $mpClockDepth gte 2>>你这一趟已深入机括腹地，齿轮轰鸣声震得耳膜发麻。<</if>><<if $mpClockChainDone["escapement"] and $mpClockChainDone["steam"] and $mpClockChainDone["armillary"] and $mpClockChainDone["vault"]>>主擒纵轮、冷却塔、星象台与密库保险柜都已探过，只余齿轮咬合的余音。<<else>>近处回廊通向主擒纵轮轴，西侧暗门则透出冷却塔的白雾。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回机括城 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpClockDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[探主擒纵轮廊 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Escapement Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Clockwork Escapement Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[钻蒸汽冷却塔道 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Steam Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Clockwork Steam Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpClockChainDone["armillary"]>>
<<mpastroicon>><<link [[登星象仪台 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Armillary Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpClockLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpClockLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Clockwork Armillary Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[摸进密库保险柜群 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Vault Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpClockLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpClockLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Clockwork Vault Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Pool Abbey [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpAbbeyChainDone to ($mpAbbeyChainDone or {})>>
<<set _mpAbbeyDay to ((window.Time and Time.days) or 0)>><<if $mpAbbeyLamp is undefined>><<set $mpAbbeyLamp to 2>><</if>><<if $mpAbbeyLamp lte 0 and $mpAbbeyOilDay isnot _mpAbbeyDay>><<set $mpAbbeyLamp to 1>><<set $mpAbbeyOilDay to _mpAbbeyDay>><</if>><<set $mpAbbeyLamp to Math.clamp($mpAbbeyLamp, 0, 5)>>
<<set $mpAbbeyAlert to Math.clamp(($mpAbbeyAlert or 0), 0, 10)>><<set $mpAbbeyDepth to Math.clamp(($mpAbbeyDepth or 0), 0, 3)>>
冷雾混着没药残香漫过沉没修道院的断柱外庭，暗河水声在青石台阶下低沉回荡。<<if $mpAbbeyLamp lte 0>>手里的牛角提灯已经油尽，幽暗拱廊里一步一滑。<<else>>提灯里尚存灯油，微光映出石壁上的苦修浮雕。<</if>><<if $mpAbbeyAlert gte 6>>回廊深处铜钟急响，守院僧侣正提灯巡查各处暗门。<<elseif $mpAbbeyDepth gte 2>>你这一趟已走入古院深处，脚下暗河正悄然涨水。<</if>><<if $mpAbbeyChainDone["cloister"] and $mpAbbeyChainDone["waterway"] and $mpAbbeyChainDone["scriptorium"] and $mpAbbeyChainDone["belfry"]>>回廊祷告席、地窖水道、抄经室与钟楼烛台都已探明，只剩钟声散尽后的余波。<<else>>北侧拱门连着回廊祷告席，下层石阶则没入地窖暗河水道。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回古修道院 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpAbbeyDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<templeicon>><<link [[探回廊祷告席 (0:06)|MP Region Abbey Cloister Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Abbey Cloister Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpboaticon>><<link [[入地窖暗河水道 (0:07)|MP Region Abbey Waterway Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Abbey Waterway Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpAbbeyChainDone["scriptorium"]>>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[进抄经室 (0:08)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpAbbeyLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpAbbeyLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Abbey Scriptorium Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[登残破钟楼探烛台 (0:08)|MP Region Abbey Belfry Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpAbbeyLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpAbbeyLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Abbey Belfry Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Pool Glasshouse [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpGlassChainDone to ($mpGlassChainDone or {})>>
<<set _mpGlassDay to ((window.Time and Time.days) or 0)>><<if $mpGlassLamp is undefined>><<set $mpGlassLamp to 2>><</if>><<if $mpGlassLamp lte 0 and $mpGlassOilDay isnot _mpGlassDay>><<set $mpGlassLamp to 1>><<set $mpGlassOilDay to _mpGlassDay>><</if>><<set $mpGlassLamp to Math.clamp($mpGlassLamp, 0, 5)>>
<<set $mpGlassAlert to Math.clamp(($mpGlassAlert or 0), 0, 10)>><<set $mpGlassDepth to Math.clamp(($mpGlassDepth or 0), 0, 3)>>
温润水雾裹着夜光兰的幽香漫过玻璃温室的雕花铁廊，恒温铜管在藤蔓间发出细微嘶鸣。<<if $mpGlassLamp lte 0>>手里的黄铜风灯已经断油，花影深处真假难辨。<<else>>风灯里还有余油，暖光映亮了雾气凝成的露珠。<</if>><<if $mpGlassAlert gte 6>>外围回廊响起护院犬的低吠，庄园守卫正沿着花径搜检。<<elseif $mpGlassDepth gte 2>>你这一趟已走入温室深处，湿热雾气闷得人胸口微紧。<</if>><<if $mpGlassChainDone["orchid"] and $mpGlassChainDone["cellar"] and $mpGlassChainDone["terrace"] and $mpGlassChainDone["dome"]>>兰花标本厅、地下冰窖、露台日晷与穹顶阀门都已探遍，只余水雾滴落的余响。<<else>>东侧玻璃门通向兰花标本厅，砖砌暗阶则直通地下酿造冰窖。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回秘密温室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpGlassDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<gardenicon>><<link [[探兰花标本厅 (0:06)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Glasshouse Orchid Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcellaricon>><<link [[下探酿造室冰窖 (0:07)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Glasshouse Cellar Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpGlassChainDone["terrace"]>>
<<mpastroicon>><<link [[登露台查石雕日晷 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Terrace Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpGlassLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpGlassLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Glasshouse Terrace Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[拧穹顶阀 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Dome Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpGlassLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpGlassLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Glasshouse Dome Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Pool Blackiron [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpIronChainDone to ($mpIronChainDone or {})>>
<<set _mpIronDay to ((window.Time and Time.days) or 0)>><<if $mpIronLamp is undefined>><<set $mpIronLamp to 2>><</if>><<if $mpIronLamp lte 0 and $mpIronOilDay isnot _mpIronDay>><<set $mpIronLamp to 1>><<set $mpIronOilDay to _mpIronDay>><</if>><<set $mpIronLamp to Math.clamp($mpIronLamp, 0, 5)>>
<<set $mpIronAlert to Math.clamp(($mpIronAlert or 0), 0, 10)>><<set $mpIronDepth to Math.clamp(($mpIronDepth or 0), 0, 3)>>
煤烟味混着铁锈气息笼罩着黑铁货站的废弃股道，生锈的枕木与闷罐车厢在夜风里嘎吱作响。<<if $mpIronLamp lte 0>>手里的铁路信号提灯已经断油，车厢夹缝黑得不见五指。<<else>>信号提灯尚存余油，红绿滤镜透出微弱光斑。<</if>><<if $mpIronAlert gte 6>>塔台弧光探照灯正来回扫射股道，铁路护卫吹响了警哨。<<elseif $mpIronDepth gte 2>>你这一趟已深入调车场腹地，四周尽是封存的军械车皮。<</if>><<if $mpIronChainDone["platform"] and $mpIronChainDone["armored"] and $mpIronChainDone["watertower"] and $mpIronChainDone["sluice"]>>站台信号灯、军械煤车、给水塔与下水闸钟表都已摸清，只余风吹铁轨的余音。<<else>>近处枕木通向废弃站台，北侧股道则停着覆满煤布的军械车。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回黑铁货站 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpIronDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[探站台信号灯 (0:06)|MP Region Blackiron Platform Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Blackiron Platform Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[摸进军械煤车股道 (0:07)|MP Region Blackiron Armored Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Blackiron Armored Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<if !$mpIronChainDone["watertower"]>>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[攀给水塔 (0:08)|MP Region Blackiron Watertower Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpIronLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpIronLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Blackiron Watertower Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[探下水闸信号钟 (0:08)|MP Region Blackiron Sluice Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpIronLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpIronLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Blackiron Sluice Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Pool Druid [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpDruidChainDone to ($mpDruidChainDone or {})>>
<<set _mpDruidDay to ((window.Time and Time.days) or 0)>><<if $mpDruidLamp is undefined>><<set $mpDruidLamp to 2>><</if>><<if $mpDruidLamp lte 0 and $mpDruidOilDay isnot _mpDruidDay>><<set $mpDruidLamp to 1>><<set $mpDruidOilDay to _mpDruidDay>><</if>><<set $mpDruidLamp to Math.clamp($mpDruidLamp, 0, 5)>>
<<set $mpDruidAlert to Math.clamp(($mpDruidAlert or 0), 0, 10)>><<set $mpDruidDepth to Math.clamp(($mpDruidDepth or 0), 0, 3)>>
浓重的松脂寒雾漫过古德鲁伊石环的十二根风化石柱，腐殖土下的暗泉发出低沉呜咽。<<if $mpDruidLamp lte 0>>手里的松脂风灯已经断油，盘错的古树根间一步一陷。<<else>>风灯里尚存松脂灯膏，暖黄光晕照亮了石柱上的螺旋刻痕。<</if>><<if $mpDruidAlert gte 6>>外围密林传来狼群的呼应低嚎与银鹰哨响，巡林哨兵正沿着兽径搜寻。<<elseif $mpDruidDepth gte 2>>你这一趟已深入石环腹地，林冠遮蔽了天光。<</if>><<if $mpDruidChainDone["stones"] and $mpDruidChainDone["rootcave"] and $mpDruidChainDone["watchtower"] and $mpDruidChainDone["altar"]>>石阵月井、根窟地脉、瞭望木塔与白鹿祭坛都已探明，只余林风拂过槲寄生的余响。<<else>>北侧苔径通往石阵月井，东侧泥壁则露出根窟暗渠的入口。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回古石环 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpDruidDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<if $mpDruidChainDone["stones"]>><<link [[石阵月井余波 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Stones Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Stones Chain"] to 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[探石阵与月井 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Stones Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Stones Chain"] to 1>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<caveicon>><<if $mpDruidChainDone["rootcave"]>><<link [[根窟地脉的余波 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Rootcave Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Rootcave Chain"] to 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[下古根地脉洞窟 (0:07)|MP Region Druid Rootcave Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Rootcave Chain"] to 1>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<if $mpDruidChainDone["watchtower"]>><<link [[听塔上余音 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Watchtower Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpDruidLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Watchtower Chain"] to 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[登塔听狼嚎 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Watchtower Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpDruidLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Watchtower Chain"] to 1>><</link>><</if>>
<<if $mpDruidChainDone["watchtower"]>>
<br>
<<link [[寻林间白鹿古祭坛 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Altar Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpDruidLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpDruidLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Druid Altar Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Pool Velvet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpVelvetChainDone to ($mpVelvetChainDone or {})>>
<<set _mpVelvetDay to ((window.Time and Time.days) or 0)>><<if $mpVelvetLamp is undefined>><<set $mpVelvetLamp to 2>><</if>><<if $mpVelvetLamp lte 0 and $mpVelvetOilDay isnot _mpVelvetDay>><<set $mpVelvetLamp to 1>><<set $mpVelvetOilDay to _mpVelvetDay>><</if>><<set $mpVelvetLamp to Math.clamp($mpVelvetLamp, 0, 5)>>
<<set $mpVelvetAlert to Math.clamp(($mpVelvetAlert or 0), 0, 10)>><<set $mpVelvetDepth to Math.clamp(($mpVelvetDepth or 0), 0, 3)>>
白麝香与陈年香槟的甜腻气息萦绕在天鹅绒暗层的波斯地毯上，帷幔后隐约漏出低沉的大提琴弦音。<<if $mpVelvetLamp lte 0>>手里的紫晶暗灯已经燃尽，屏风夹道里黑影重重。<<else>>暗灯里尚存香蜡，微光映亮了壁龛里的羽毛假面。<</if>><<if $mpVelvetAlert gte 6>>走廊两头响起银狐执事的皮靴声，侍者正逐间核查贵宾请柬。<<elseif $mpVelvetDepth gte 2>>你这一趟已深入暗层腹地，连廊外的海浪声清晰可闻。<</if>><<if $mpVelvetChainDone["masque"] and $mpVelvetChainDone["salon"] and $mpVelvetChainDone["terrace"] and $mpVelvetChainDone["cellar"]>>假面回廊、试衣拍卖厅、观海露台与地锁暗窖都已探遍，只余弦音散去后的余波。<<else>>前廊壁龛陈列着银狐假面，东侧屏风则连着旋转试衣台与拍卖暗厅。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回天鹅绒 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpVelvetDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<cosmeticsicon>><<if $mpVelvetChainDone["masque"]>><<link [[丝绒假面余波 (0:06)|MP Region Velvet Masque Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Velvet Masque Chain"] to 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[探丝绒假面厅 (0:06)|MP Region Velvet Masque Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Velvet Masque Chain"] to 1>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mptailoricon>><<if $mpVelvetChainDone["salon"]>><<link [[试衣拍卖暗厅余波 (0:07)|MP Region Velvet Salon Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Velvet Salon Chain"] to 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[进试衣与拍卖暗厅 (0:07)|MP Region Velvet Salon Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Velvet Salon Chain"] to 1>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<windowicon>><<if $mpVelvetChainDone["terrace"]>><<link [[峭壁观海台余波 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Terrace Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpVelvetLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpVelvetLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Velvet Terrace Chain"] to 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[登峭壁观海露台 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Terrace Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpVelvetLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpVelvetLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Velvet Terrace Chain"] to 1>><</link>><</if>>
<<if $mpVelvetChainDone["terrace"]>>
<br>
<<link [[探地窖暗门 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Cellar Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpVelvetLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpVelvetLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Velvet Cellar Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Pool Observatory [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>><<set $mpObsChainDone to ($mpObsChainDone or {})>>
<<set _mpObsDay to ((window.Time and Time.days) or 0)>><<if $mpObsLamp is undefined>><<set $mpObsLamp to 2>><</if>><<if $mpObsLamp lte 0 and $mpObsOilDay isnot _mpObsDay>><<set $mpObsLamp to 1>><<set $mpObsOilDay to _mpObsDay>><</if>><<set $mpObsLamp to Math.clamp($mpObsLamp, 0, 5)>>
<<set $mpObsAlert to Math.clamp(($mpObsAlert or 0), 0, 10)>><<set $mpObsDepth to Math.clamp(($mpObsDepth or 0), 0, 3)>>
樟木与陈年羊皮星图的清香在旧天文翼楼的木拱廊间浮动，屋顶风速计随夜风发出细碎轻响。<<if $mpObsLamp lte 0>>手里的黄铜阅读灯已经断油，高耸的画筒架间伸手不见五指。<<else>>阅读灯里尚存精馏灯油，暖光映出地板滑轨上的刻度。<</if>><<if $mpObsAlert gte 6>>连廊尽头晃动着手电光柱，守夜教工与值日学长正挨间查锁。<<elseif $mpObsDepth gte 2>>你这一趟已走入翼楼深处，脚下木梁随钟摆微微共振。<</if>><<if $mpObsChainDone["dome"] and $mpObsChainDone["starmap"] and $mpObsChainDone["pendulum"] and $mpObsChainDone["meteorite"]>>折光穹顶、星图档案室、连廊钟摆与陨石密室都已探过，只余风吹拱窗的余音。<<else>>北侧滑轨直通折光穹顶室，樟木暗门后则是高耸的星图档案架。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回旧翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><<set $mpObsDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpastroicon>><<if $mpObsChainDone["dome"]>><<link [[折光穹顶余波 (0:06)|MP Region Observatory Dome Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Observatory Dome Chain"] to 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[探折光穹顶室 (0:06)|MP Region Observatory Dome Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Observatory Dome Chain"] to 1>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<if $mpObsChainDone["starmap"]>><<link [[星图档案室余波 (0:07)|MP Region Observatory Starmap Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Observatory Starmap Chain"] to 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[进星图档案查卷 (0:07)|MP Region Observatory Starmap Chain]]>><<pass 7>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Observatory Starmap Chain"] to 1>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<if $mpObsChainDone["pendulum"]>><<link [[听连廊钟摆 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Pendulum Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpObsLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpObsLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Observatory Pendulum Chain"] to 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[走连廊钟摆 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Pendulum Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpObsLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpObsLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Observatory Pendulum Chain"] to 1>><</link>><</if>>
<<if $mpObsChainDone["pendulum"]>>
<br>
<<link [[探标本暗阁与陨石 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Meteorite Chain]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpObsLamp to Math.max(0, ($mpObsLamp or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSeenScenes["MP Region Observatory Meteorite Chain"] to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Island [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_pier"] to 1>>
海雾在孤悬外海的黑色礁岛四周翻涌，高耸的雾角灯塔立在岩崖顶上。潮水拍打着岛屿南侧的系船石阶，咸涩的浪沫随风扑面而来。
<<if $willpower gte 450 or $athletics gte 250>>你稳住呼吸踩实湿滑的礁盘，在浓雾里辨清了近处的方向。<<else>>湿冷的狂风吹得你步履微晃，视线被浓雾遮去了大半。<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>冷雨混着海浪拍在礁石上，灯塔顶部的雾角每隔半分钟便发出一声低沉的长鸣。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海礁 (0:18)|Sea Rocks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<pass 18>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿栈桥探雾角 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Pier Chain]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpFogDepth to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[留意礁岸动静 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Island Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[问守船老汉 (0:05)|MP Region Foghorn Island Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpMicroNotice and $mpMicroNotice["foghorn_bell"]>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[看报雾铜钟 (0:04)|MP Region Micro Foghorn Bell]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Foghorn">><<link [[巡看礁岸四周 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Foghorn]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Foghorn Island Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你贴着背风岩壁放慢脚步，借着灯塔微光观察崖壁与潮汐走向。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:02)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-foghorn-island-scout">
<<mpclimbicon>><<link "摸索岩壁铁索 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-foghorn-island-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"] to 1>>你在岩壁苔藓间摸到半掩的铁扶手，<span class="green">发现了通往守塔人旧居的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往断桅沉船滩的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["foghorn_echo"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_echo"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往海蚀回音廊的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你沿着四周暗径巡看了一圈，<span class="teal">眼下并无新的异动。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	浓雾合拢，湿滑页岩让你脚下一滑磕在石棱上，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<beachicon>><<link "攀上礁脊眺望 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-foghorn-island-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["foghorn_echo"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_echo"] to 1>>你站在礁脊高处看清了崖下暗径，<span class="green">锁定了海蚀回音廊的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了断桅沉船滩的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了守塔人旧居的入口。</span>
	<<else>>镜面里各处门道都已被你看遍，<span class="teal">没有新的暗门。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	横风夹浪扑来，你在礁盘上晃了晃，<span class="red">只得先退回外围观察。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Foghorn Island Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
系船石阶旁蹲着添煤油的守船老汉，你上前打听岛上僻静去处。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:02)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-foghorn-island-ask">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "问老汉路 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-foghorn-island-ask">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"] to 1>>老汉抬起烟斗指了指雾中方向：<span class="green">告诉了你守塔人旧居的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你断桅沉船滩的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["foghorn_echo"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_echo"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你海蚀回音廊的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这儿的门道你已摸得一清二楚。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	老汉拧紧油壶盖转身不理，<span class="red">半句口风都不肯漏给你。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link "提旧港切口套近乎 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-foghorn-island-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"] to 1>>老汉听出你懂水路规矩，压低嗓音指点：<span class="green">为你指明了断桅沉船滩的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["foghorn_echo"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_echo"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了海蚀回音廊的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了守塔人旧居的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">提醒你里头陈设一切照旧。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你说的切口不够地道，老汉警惕地眯起眼，<span class="red">警告你别往深处乱闯。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Foghorn Pier [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_pier"] to 1>>
青石垒成的古老栈桥延伸入迷雾笼罩的海面，系船石柱上缠着潮湿的旧缆绳与墨绿海草。浪涌拍击着桥墩木桩激起细碎白沫，栈桥各处早已被你寻访过，只余海风吹拂衣角与远处海鸟掠过的余音。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回雾角岛 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[顺石阶去旧居外 (0:05)|MP Region Foghorn Keeper]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[驻足探看礁石海鸟 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Keeper [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_keeper"] to 1>>
半嵌在断崖岩壁里的守塔人旧居静悄悄的，厚重的橡木窗板挡住了外海的风浪。壁炉与木桌抽屉都已被你检视过，屋里只留着淡淡的松木烟气与窗外低沉的潮声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回雾角岛 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[顺岩径去断桅滩 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Wreck]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Wreck [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"] to 1>>
退潮后的弧形卵石滩上，早年触礁商船的腐朽肋木斜插在黑色湿沙里。挂满藤壶的断桅与底舱都已探明，浅水洼里倒映着铅灰色的天光，只剩浪花一趟趟漫过沙面。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回雾角岛 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿水线去回音廊 (0:06)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Region Foghorn Echo [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_echo"] to 1>>
海浪冲刷而成的天然石拱长廊蜿蜒深入崖底，穿堂风在蜂窝状的盐晶孔洞间激起管风琴般的低鸣。廊内的气孔与石龛都已被你探过，水洼清澈见底，只留层层叠叠的潮音回响。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回雾角岛 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<caveicon "torch">><<link [[循潮音探深处暗穴 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork Undercity [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_corridor"] to 1>>
顺着高街钟塔基座下方的石阶深入地底，一座维多利亚式的青铜机括空间展现在眼前。巨型齿轮沿着拱顶缓缓啮合，脚下的铸铁格栅传来低沉的机械震颤。
<<if $science gte 260 or $maths gte 260>>你借着煤气壁灯看清了主传动轴的转向，稳稳踏上检修平台。<<else>>错综复杂的铜管与轰鸣声让你一时难以分清深处的布局。<</if>>
<<if ($tiredness or 0) gte 800>>地底温热的蒸汽与规律的擒纵声交织在一起，让你略微疲惫的眼皮有些发沉。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:10)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 10>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[返回齿轮回廊 (0:05)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去机括城 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[问检修学徒 (0:05)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpMicroNotice and $mpMicroNotice["clockwork_oil"]>>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[看滴油铜杯 (0:04)|MP Region Micro Clockwork Oil]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Clockwork">><<link [[巡看回廊四周 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Clockwork]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Clockwork Undercity Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你扶着温热的黄铜栏杆俯身，顺着铸铁格栅下的导轨辨认通路。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回机括城 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-clockwork-undercity-scout">
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link "摸查管廊阀门 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-undercity-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["clockwork_steam"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>>你顺着紫铜副管摸到一扇检修门，<span class="green">发现了通往蒸汽压力室的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_astro"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往停摆天文台的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_vault"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往档案馆密库的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你把附近僻静小路排查了一遍，<span class="teal">暂未瞧见异常迹象。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	滚烫蒸汽突然从泄压阀喷出，惊得你连忙缩手，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link "攀上吊轨横梁 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-undercity-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["clockwork_vault"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>>你从高处横梁看清了齿轮后方的暗廊，<span class="green">锁定了档案馆密库的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_astro"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了停摆天文台的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_steam"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了蒸汽压力室的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">下方各处小径都已了然于胸。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	横梁满是滑腻机油，你差点踩空跌落，<span class="red">只好暂且收住深入的念头。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Clockwork Undercity Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
油杯立柱旁站着拎铜壶的检修学徒，你上前打听地底门道。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回机括城 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-clockwork-undercity-ask">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "问学徒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-undercity-ask">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["clockwork_steam"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>>学徒擦了擦汗，指了指侧方通道：<span class="green">告诉了你蒸汽压力室的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_astro"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你停摆天文台的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_vault"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你档案馆密库的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这片地方的底细你早已知晓。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	学徒赶着去添机油，摇手让你别挡路，<span class="red">冷淡地将你打发了回去。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link "报出钟表铺编号 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-undercity-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["clockwork_astro"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>>学徒认出塞拉的修表暗号，低声透露：<span class="green">为你指明了停摆天文台的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_vault"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了档案馆密库的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["clockwork_steam"]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了蒸汽压力室的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">说里面眼下平顺如常。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你报错了齿号，学徒狐疑地退后半步，<span class="red">示意你立刻退回外围区域。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Clockwork Corridor [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_corridor"] to 1>>
两侧石壁嵌满了缓慢转动的黄铜从动轮，地面铺着防滑的铸铁格栅。每过三秒，两米高的主擒纵叉便发出一声清脆的金属咬合声。
<<if $science gte 250 or $athletics gte 250>>你踩着擒纵轮停顿的节拍穿行，避开了甩出机油的轴承。<<else>>飞转的齿轮近在咫尺，震得你耳膜嗡嗡作响。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[俯身查看检修槽 (0:09)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor Search]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[返回齿轮回廊 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"]>>
<<mpsmokeicon>><<link [[去蒸汽室 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "数擒纵咬合声 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-clockwork-corridor">>
<<if $science gte 250 or $maths gte 250>>
你数准主擒纵叉每三秒一次的停顿，发现轴承旁有一道新上的机油痕，顺着它能看到蒸汽压力室的检修门。
<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>><br><<link [[去蒸汽室 (0:07)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
齿轮的咬合声密得像雨点，你数到一半就乱了拍子，只觉耳膜发胀。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-clockwork-corridor"></div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[查看卡齿火星 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Clockwork Corridor Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你再次半跪在主传动轴旁，检修槽的盖板早被人掀开，槽底只剩一层温热的润滑油渍与几粒崩落的铁屑。齿轮依旧按着老节拍咬合，可这一处已经被翻检得干干净净，再没有可拿走的东西了。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回回廊 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Clockwork Corridor Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你退到齿轮回廊拐角恒温的铸铁护栏边坐下，背靠着干燥的石柱。
<br><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[返回齿轮回廊 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-clockwork-corridor-rest-choices">
<<bedicon>><<link "贴着恒温护栏暖背 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-corridor-rest-choices">>
<<if $willpower gte 430 or $science gte 250>>
规律沉稳的擒纵摆动声渐渐与你的心跳重合，<span class="green">地底恒温的暖气烘干了衣角潮意。你紧绷的神经安定下来。</span>
<<tiredness -4>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
刺耳的金属摩擦声在耳边反复回荡，震得脚底铁栅微微发麻。你捂着耳朵坐了一会儿，<span class="red">只觉得太阳穴隐隐作痛。</span>
<<stress 4>><<pain 1>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "擦去鞋底沾的机油 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-corridor-rest-choices">>
你在防滑铁格栅边缘刮净鞋底机油，<span class="teal">借着地底恒温暖意歇了歇腿。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Clockwork Steam [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>>
粗大的紫铜管道在拱室中央交汇，水银压力表的指针随着白雾喷吐轻轻颤动。空气里弥漫着温热的黄铜与冷凝水气息。
<<if $science gte 280 or $physique gte 11500>>你避开正在泄压的法兰气口，沿着干燥的检修铁廊稳步前行。<<else>>闷热的蒸汽扑面而来，熏得你额头沁出一层细汗。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[靠近备用冷凝管 (0:10)|MP Region Clockwork Steam Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[去蒸汽室 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Steam Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"]>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去停摆天文台 (0:10)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "看压力表回摆 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-clockwork-steam">>
<<if $science gte 280 or $physique gte 11500>>
你盯住水银柱的细微回摆，判断出备用管正在缓慢泄压；管壁上的粉笔箭头指向停摆天文台。
<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>><br><<link [[去停摆天文台 (0:10)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
白雾糊住表盘，你只看见指针在红线附近乱颤，不敢贸然靠近。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-clockwork-steam"></div>
<</if>>


