<<walkicon>><<link [[回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Clockwork Steam Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你挑了一段包着隔热石棉布的副蒸汽管旁坐下，借着温热的气流烘烤微凉的指尖。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回蒸汽室 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-clockwork-steam-rest-choices">
