<<if $physique gte 11500 or $willpower gte 440>>
温和的热力顺着后背传遍全身，<span class="green">驱散了深入地底积累的寒意与疲乏。你靠着石壁舒舒服服地歇够了力气。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -4>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
三号锅炉的水银表突然越过红线发出尖锐嘶鸣，闷热的白雾瞬间充斥四周，<span class="red">呛得你喘不过气来。你狼狈地逃开锅炉边。</span>
<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link "松开领口扣 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-clockwork-steam-rest-choices">>
你解开领口第一枚纽扣透了透气，<span class="teal">温热的铜管把指尖烘得暖融融的。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Clockwork Astro [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_astro"] to 1>>
地底穹顶下悬挂着一座靠发条驱动的黄铜天球仪，镶嵌在圆环上的荧光石映射着地面星轨。四周石桌上散落着半打磨好的水晶透镜。
<<if $maths gte 280 or $history gte 280>>你认出了浑天仪基座上的黄道十二宫刻度。<<else>>繁复交错的星轨铜环让你看得眼花缭乱。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpastroicon>><<link [[检查浑天仪底座 (0:13)|MP Region Clockwork Astro Search]]>><<pass 13>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[坐真皮观测椅小憩 (0:08)|MP Region Clockwork Astro Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
