:: MP Region Sunken Abbey [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_steps"] to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set $mpAbbeyTorch to ($mpAbbeyTorch or 3)>><<set $mpAbbeyWater to ($mpAbbeyWater or 0)>>
<<if $mpAbbeyVisited>>
你再次顺着坍塌的旋梯步入沉没修道院外庭。潮湿的哥特式柱廊间滴着冷水，上次留下的脚印早已被渗出的泥水漫过，石龛里的没药残香比初来时更冷了几分。
<<else>>
顺着坍塌石廊后的古老旋梯拾级而下，百年前因地基沉降而没入地底的哥特式修道院外庭映入眼帘。长明石灯在潮湿的柱廊间投下森冷光影，深处传来空洞的水滴回响。
<</if>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>地底深处隐约飘来低沉的晚祷余音，守墓苦修士的脚步声在长廊尽头回荡。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回狼街神殿 (0:12)|Temple]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<set $mpAbbeyVisited to 1>><<pass 12>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><<set $mpAlertArea to "">><</link>>
<br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[举起石龛火把探路 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Torch]]>><<set $mpAbbeyVisited to 1>><<set $mpAbbeyTorch to 3>><<set $mpAbbeyWater to 0>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[走去静默石阶 (0:06)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<set $mpAbbeyVisited to 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpMicroNotice and $mpMicroNotice["abbey_wick"]>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[挑亮残灯芯 (0:04)|MP Region Micro Abbey Wick]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Abbey">><<link [[巡看外庭四周 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Abbey]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<<if $mpClues and $mpClues["abbey_prayer"] and $mpClues["abbey_timber"] and $mpClues["abbey_sarcophagus"]>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link "比对三处线索 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<set $mpClues["abbey_deep"] to 1>><<stress -3>><<replace "#abbey-clue-out">>
你把祷文、船木烙印与石棺刻痕摊在长明灯下，一处一处对过去。祷文说暗流连着圣堂地基，船木证明它通向海湾礁洞，石棺上的日期又正好对上铁栅门锁芯的齿位。三处指向同一条水路，也指向同一批把东西从地底运出去的人。<span class="teal">这条线现在有了名字。</span>
<</replace>><</link>>
<div id="abbey-clue-out"></div>
<<elseif $mpClues and $mpClues["abbey_deep"]>>
<br>
<span class="teal">三处线索已经对上了，暗河的走向你心里有数。</span>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Torch [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpAbbeyTorch to Math.max(0, ($mpAbbeyTorch or 3) - 1)>>
你从石龛中拔出一支浸过松脂的火把。橘红的火苗噼啪作响，松烟味驱散了面前的寒气，照亮了外庭尽头一处半塌的尖拱暗道。脚下的石缝正缓缓往外渗着凉水，火把的油脂在阴风里消耗得很快，前方很快分成一高一低两条去路。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回修道院外庭 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[走向尖拱岔路 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Fork]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[摸索断壁刮痕 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Scout]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[问守墓苦修 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Ask]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpAbbeyWater to ($mpAbbeyWater or 0) + 1>>
你举高火把，顺着断壁浮雕与地面的铁器刮痕摸索。头顶拱券忽然掉下几块碎石，暗河涌上来的潮气已经漫过了鞋底。
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
<<if !$mpKnown["abbey_confess"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_confess"] to 1>>你在枯藤后摸到一道虚掩的侧门，<span class="green">记下了通往告解回音壁的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] to 1>>你循着石阶折痕往里看，<span class="green">看清了通往灰烬藏经阁的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_ferry"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_ferry"] to 1>>你听清了水声来向，<span class="green">摸准了地下暗河渡口的位置。</span><<else>>四周的暗道走向都已印在脑海里。<</if>>
<<else>>
枯藤后的碎石冷不防滑落砸在脚背上，你脚下一滑，被呛人的灰尘逼退了半步。<<pain 2>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回外庭入口处 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转入尖拱岔路 (0:04)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Fork]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[攀向断壁高梁之上 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Climb]]>><<mpalert 6>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
柱廊阴影下立着一名添香油的守墓苦修士，宽大的灰袍遮住了面容。你压低声音上前打听地底旧殿的去路。
<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($history or 0) gte 220>>
苦修士停下添油的铜壶，合十低语了几句古教团的祝词，抬指点向尖拱廊柱后方。<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<if !$mpKnown["abbey_confess"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_confess"] to 1>><span class="green">你记下了前往告解回音壁的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] to 1>><span class="green">你记下了前往灰烬藏经阁的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["abbey_ferry"]>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_ferry"] to 1>><span class="green">你记下了前往暗河渡口的走法。</span><</if>>
<<else>>
苦修士只是冷淡地摇了摇头，提着铜灯转身走向石廊深处，让你不要在禁地久留。<<stress 3>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回修道院外庭去 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[循着钟声寻出口 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Return]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[迈入尖拱岔路 (0:04)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Fork]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Fork [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpAbbeyWater to ($mpAbbeyWater or 0) + 1>>
尖拱暗道在这里裂成三条去向。上方的断壁横梁挂着半截旧麻绳，隐约能看见旧礼拜龛；右侧是一扇生满铜绿的铁栅暗门，锁孔细密；下方则是不断涨水的石砌暗渠，冷冽的暗河水已经漫上了第三级台阶，黑暗中传来沉重的呼吸声与碎石滚落的轻响。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回火把龛 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Torch]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[抓绳攀上断壁横梁 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Climb]]>><<mpalert 5>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[撬开铁栅门锁芯 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Vault]]>><<mpalert 6>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<elseif $mpClues and $mpClues["abbey_sarcophagus"]>>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[按刻痕暗号开门 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Vault]]>><<mpalert 4>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[涉水走进暗渠 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Wade]]>><<tiredness 1>><<stress 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Climb [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpAbbeyTorch to Math.max(0, ($mpAbbeyTorch or 2) - 1)>>
你攥紧垂下的旧麻绳，踩着湿滑的凸起石砖往断壁高处攀爬。头顶的石拱忽然咔嚓作响，几块松动的灰岩擦着肩膀坠入下方的黑水里。
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11000>>
<<set _climbOk to 1>>
你借着腰腹力道一跃翻上横梁，稳稳落在一处干燥的残破礼拜龛前，石壁上刻满了褪色的古字。<<tiredness 1>><<gtiredness>>
<<else>>
<<set _climbOk to 0>>
脚下的青苔石砖猛地崩裂，你手上一滑，整个人顺着倾斜的断坡直接摔进了下方的坍塌泥坑里。<<pain 3>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if _climbOk is 1>>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[退回侧廊壁道 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Return]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[走近残破礼拜龛 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Prayer]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[撑身爬出泥坑 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Mud]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[滑进下方暗渠 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Wade]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Mud [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpAbbeyWater to ($mpAbbeyWater or 0) + 1>>
<<set _deep to (($mpAbbeyWater or 0) gte 4)>>
冰冷刺骨的淤泥没过了小腿，上方不时有细碎的塌方石块砸落。黑暗深处传来守墓人提灯巡视的铁链声与低促的呼吸声，水位正肉眼可见地往上漫。
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
你咬紧牙关屏住呼吸，借着石缝里的树根一点点把腿从淤泥里拔了出来。<<tiredness 2>><<gtiredness>>
<<if _deep>>水已经漫到膝弯，你每拔出一条腿，另一条就往下陷得更深，等爬上浅滩时两条腿都在抖。<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>><</if>>
<<else>>
你在湿冷的淤泥里越陷越深，衣摆被泥水浸透，好不容易才扒住一块凸起的断碑爬上浅滩。<<pain 2>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<upperwet 60>><<lowerwet 60>><<gpain>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[钻出排水阶 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Return]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[爬向浅滩沉船木 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Timber]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcellaricon>><<link [[钻进偏殿石棺暗廊 (0:07)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Sarcophagus]]>><<mpalert 5>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 7>><</link>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Vault [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpAbbeyTorch to Math.max(0, ($mpAbbeyTorch or 2) - 1)>>
你用细铁丝抵住铜锁簧片轻轻一挑，锈蚀的铁栅暗门应声弹开一条窄缝。门后是一条干爽的夹壁密道，避开了下方湍急的涨水。走廊两侧立着历代苦修士的石棺，墙角的巡夜铜铃随穿堂风轻轻晃动，远处隐约传来守墓人规律的脚步声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回夹壁门 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Return]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcellaricon>><<link [[查看偏殿石棺刻痕 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Sarcophagus]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplampicon>><<link [[登上内侧礼拜龛 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Prayer]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Wade [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpAbbeyWater to ($mpAbbeyWater or 0) + 1>>
<<set _deep to (($mpAbbeyWater or 0) gte 4)>>
你踏进齐腰深的地下暗渠，冰冷的暗河水立刻浸透了裤脚。水底暗流湍急，上方石拱不时落下一阵水珠。
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 220 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
你稳住重心贴着石壁逆流前行，将手中的火把高高举过水面，顺利摸到了暗河拐角处的搁浅木块。<<tiredness 2>><<gtiredness>>
<<if _deep>>水位比上次高了一截，暗流几次把你往石壁上推，你不得不把火把换到外侧手，肩膀被冷水泡得发麻。<<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>><</if>>
<<else>>
<<set $mpAbbeyTorch to 0>><<upperwet 100>><<lowerwet 100>>
一股暗流猛地卷过脚踝，你脚下一软呛了一口冷水，手中的火把啪地掉进水里熄灭了，浑身上下湿透得直打寒颤。<<stress 5>><<pain 2>><<tiredness 3>><<gstress>><<gpain>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[游向暗渠出口 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Return]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[摸索搁浅的沉船木 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Timber]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpropeicon>><<link [[爬向泥坑浅滩 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Mud]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Prayer [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if $mpClues["abbey_prayer"]>>
礼拜龛的石壁上留着你上次拓印过的灰白指痕。那些关于旧钟塔与海潮献祭的残缺古祷文静静隐在阴影里，你没有再重复翻动，只听见下方水位上涨的哗哗声越来越近。
<<else>>
<<set $mpClues["abbey_prayer"] to 1>>
你凑近残破的礼拜龛，吹开石碑上的浮灰。碑面刻着一段百年前修道院沉没前夜的旧祷文，记载着钟塔底部的暗流与圣堂地基相连。你用炭条将祷文关键词拓在纸角贴身收好。<span class="blue">已记下旧祷文线索。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回高处回廊 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Return]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcellaricon>><<link [[转去偏殿查看石棺 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Sarcophagus]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Timber [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if $mpClues["abbey_timber"]>>
搁浅在暗河浅滩上的那截沉船肋木已经被涨上来的黑水淹了大半。木面上的铜字船名与水道烙印你早已记熟，四周的岩石缝隙里传来阵阵阴冷的穿堂风。
<<else>>
<<set $mpClues["abbey_timber"] to 1>>
你在暗河浅滩的乱石间摸到一截覆满藤壶的沉船木。腐朽的橡木内侧烙着海港走私船的暗记与年份，证明这条地下暗河直通海湾礁洞。你将木片上的烙印走向仔细记下。<span class="blue">已记下沉船木线索。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[钻出泄水暗槽 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Return]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcellaricon>><<link [[攀上偏殿石棺暗廊 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Sarcophagus]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Sarcophagus [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>><<set $mpAbbeyWater to ($mpAbbeyWater or 0) + 1>>
<<if $mpClues["abbey_sarcophagus"]>>
偏殿中央的无名石棺盖板依然留着一道窄缝，刻在棺沿内侧的名单缩写与齿轮徽记你已经拓录完毕。走廊尽头传来守墓人提灯逼近的脚步声，不宜久留。
<<else>>
<<set $mpClues["abbey_sarcophagus"] to 1>>
你借着微光俯身查看偏殿中央的石棺。棺盖边缘有一排后人用利器新添的刻痕，记录着几次秘密转运旧账册的日期与暗号。其中一组日期反复出现，齿位正好对上外头那扇铁栅门的锁芯。你将这串石棺刻痕默默背熟。<span class="blue">已记下石棺刻痕线索。</span><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[推开通风口脱身 (0:05)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Return]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdiveicon>><<link [[滑入下方浅滩查看 (0:06)|MP Region Sunken Abbey Timber]]>><<tiredness 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>


:: MP Region Sunken Abbey Return [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<if ($mpAbbeyWater or 0) gte 4>>
潮水已经漫过排水回廊，你是踩着齐膝的冷水一步步挪出去的，靴子里灌满了冰水，走一步响一声。<<tiredness 2>><<stress 2>><<gtiredness>><<gstress>>
<<elseif ($mpAbbeyTorch or 0) lte 0 and (($upperwet or 0) gte 50 or ($lowerwet or 0) gte 50)>>
火把已在暗流中熄灭，你浑身湿透、扶着冰冷石壁在黑暗里摸索前行，直到望见外庭长明灯的微光才松了口气。
<<elseif ($pain or 0) gte 20>>
你捂着磕碰发痛的伤口，避开身后塌方碎石与守墓人路线，一瘸一拐地穿出狭窄通风阶回到了外庭。
<<elseif ($mpAbbeyTorch or 0) lte 0>>
手中的火把已经燃尽，你借着石缝微弱冷光贴墙绕过巡夜脚步声，安全退回了修道院外庭。
<<else>>
你举着仅剩半截的火把，沿着干燥的排水回廊快步穿行，赶在潮水漫过石阶前推开偏门回到了入口外庭。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回到修道院外庭 (0:04)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[转往静默石阶 (0:05)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>


:: MP Region Abbey Steps [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["abbey_steps"] to 1>>
覆满青苔的宽阔石阶一路向下延伸，两侧立着双手交叠祈祷的无面苦修士石像。裂开的穹顶缝隙漏下几缕幽冷的天光。
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $willpower gte 440>>你扶着冰凉的石栏稳步拾级而下，呼吸保持着平稳。<<else>>无面石像低垂的轮廓在阴影里显得格外森冷。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回古修道院 (0:04)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[俯身查看石兽 (0:10)|MP Region Abbey Steps Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[返回静默石阶 (0:08)|MP Region Abbey Steps Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["abbey_confess"]>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回告解回音壁 (0:05)|MP Region Abbey Confess]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "数石像手势 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-abbey-steps">>
<<if $history gte 260 or $willpower gte 440>>
你发现第三尊无面石像的双手是反叠的，指节朝向石阶西侧的胡桃木侧门；门缝里透出一线昏黄。
<<set $mpKnown["abbey_confess"] to 1>><br><<link [[返回告解回音壁 (0:05)|MP Region Abbey Confess]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
石像轮廓在长明灯下忽明忽暗，你数到一半便觉得每尊都差不多。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-abbey-steps"></div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[轻叩空心石阶 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Abbey 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Abbey Steps Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "abbey">><<mpalertinit "abbey">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你伸手又探了探石兽腹腔，干燥的暗槽里只积着薄薄一层香灰，蛛网也早已被人扫落。长明灯在无面石像脚下轻轻摇晃，四周静得只剩风吹过石阶的细响。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回石阶 (0:02)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
