<<if $mpClues["abbey_confess_third"]>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[闪进第三间告解室 (0:10)|MP Region Abbey Confess Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<bedicon>><<link [[入告解木隔间静坐 (0:08)|MP Region Abbey Confess Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 80>>
<<if $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"]>>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[去灰烬藏经阁 (0:11)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 11>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "听隔间传声 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-abbey-confess">>
<<if $skulduggery gte 260 or $willpower gte 450>>
<<if !$mpClues["abbey_confess_third"]>><<set $mpClues["abbey_confess_third"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你听见穹顶把远处翻书声送进第三间隔间，跪凳下方有一块木榫被反复摩挲得发亮；隔扇后连着藏经阁的石廊。
<<set $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] to 1>><br><<link [[去灰烬藏经阁 (0:11)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 11>><</link>>
<<else>>
传声孔里只有忽远忽近的风声，你分不清哪些是脚步、哪些是回声。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-abbey-confess"></div>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 80>>
<br>
