<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_cellar"] to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
温室下方的恒温砖砌地窖里排列着十二只法国橡木桶，角落的紫铜蒸馏器正一滴滴萃取出高纯度的草木秘露。地窖内弥漫着醇厚的果木酒香。
<<if $science gte 280 or $housekeeping gte 260>>你借着壁灯看清了橡木桶上的年份烙印与冷凝水阀。<<else>>微暗的拱顶地窖里酒气浓郁，吸多了让人有些微醺。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秘密温室 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpClues["glasshouse_cellar_third"]>>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[掀开第三只桶塞 (0:14)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar Search]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<br>
<</if>>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[返回地下酿造室 (0:08)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[步入冷香窖 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "听酒桶回声 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-glasshouse-cellar">>
<<if $science gte 280 or $housekeeping gte 260>>
<<if !$mpClues["glasshouse_cellar_third"]>><<set $mpClues["glasshouse_cellar_third"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你轻叩第三只橡木桶，回声比旁边几只空了一截；桶底箍上有一道被反复撬动的划痕。
<<else>>
酒气熏得人微醺，你敲了几只桶，只听见一片沉闷的咚咚声。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-glasshouse-cellar"></div>


:: MP Region Glasshouse Cellar Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你轻叩第三只橡木桶的底箍，桶身暗格的挡板早被卸下，只剩潮湿的软木屑与一股发酵过头的酒气。紫铜蒸馏器还在角落滴答作响，地窖里再没有藏着的东西。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回酒窖 (0:02)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回秘密温室 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Glasshouse Cellar Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你坐在恒温阴凉的酿造室干草垛上，背靠着厚实的橡木酒桶缓了口气。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回地下酿造室 (0:02)|MP Region Glasshouse Cellar]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-glasshouse-cellar-rest-choices">
<<bedicon>><<link "背靠橡木酒桶缓劲 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-glasshouse-cellar-rest-choices">>
<<if $willpower gte 460 or $tending gte 260>>
温和醇厚的果木酒香让你的呼吸慢慢平顺下来，<span class="green">阴凉安静的地窖驱散了你身上的燥热与疲倦。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
地窖角落冰窖渗出的寒气顺着地面蔓延过来，冻得你双脚发麻，<span class="red">浓重的酒气也熏得你额角突突直跳。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link "搓热微凉的脚踝 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-glasshouse-cellar-rest-choices">>
你坐在松软的干草垛上揉了揉脚踝，<span class="teal">果木酒香驱散了地底的微凉。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Blackiron Yard [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
生锈的铁轨在废弃的红砖厂房与高耸的龙门吊之间纵横交错。寒风掠过空旷的碎石道砟，远处扳道器旁亮着一盏昏黄的信号提灯。
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $skulduggery gte 260>>你贴着货车阴影快步穿行，看清了脚下交错的枕木。<<else>>空旷的货运站里铁轨纵横，稍不留神就会踩响碎石。<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨水顺着生锈的龙门吊铁架淌下，在枕木凹槽里积出一汪汪泛着油花的黑水。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 100>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回麋鹿街 (0:09)|Elk Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<pass 9>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><<set $mpAlertArea to "">><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsmokeicon>><<link [[去蒸汽侧线 (0:05)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去黑铁货站 (0:06)|MP Region Blackiron Yard Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[问巡道老工 (0:05)|MP Region Blackiron Yard Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpMicroNotice and $mpMicroNotice["blackiron_wedge"] and ($mpAlert or 0) lt 80>>
	<<mplockpickicon>><<link [[撬制动楔 (0:04)|MP Region Micro Blackiron Wedge]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Blackiron">><<link [[巡看货场四周 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Blackiron]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 80>>
<br>
<div id="mp-alert-blackiron-exit">
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 100>>
<<link [[拼死一搏 (0:12)|MP Elite Encounter Blackiron Bosun]]>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "Blackiron Alert Return">><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpAlertCaught to 0>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Math.max(($seductionskill or 0), ($english or 0), ($willpower or 0)) gte 260>><<link [[虚张声势 (0:08)|MP Alert Blackiron Bluff]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[虚张声势 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "虚张声势">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[转身就跑 (0:06)|MP Alert Blackiron Flee]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[束手就擒 (0:08)|MP BadEnd Extra Blackiron Boxcar]]>><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[硬闯出去 (0:10)|MP Elite Encounter Blackiron Bosun]]>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "Blackiron Alert Return">><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpAlertCaught to 0>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Blackiron Yard Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你压低身形沿着道岔扳手摸索，借龙门吊阴影观察停靠的车皮。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-blackiron-yard-scout">
<<investigateicon>><<link "贴着闷罐车摸进 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-yard-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["blackiron_armored"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] to 1>>你顺着枕木油迹摸到隐蔽栈道，<span class="green">发现了通往三号装甲货车的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_signal"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往信号塔值班室的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_platform"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往地下走私月台的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你顺着石阶暗角走了一遭，<span class="teal">并未看出异样端倪。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	碎煤渣滑落惊动了巡夜犬，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "铁件与道砟的响动">>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link "爬上龙门吊铁梯 (0:06)">><<mpalert 12>><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-yard-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["blackiron_platform"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>>你从铁梯高处看清了场站深处的灯火，<span class="green">锁定了地下走私月台的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_signal"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了信号塔值班室的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_armored"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了三号装甲货车的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">各条隐秘通路都已记熟。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	铁梯满是冰霜，冻僵的手指险些抓空，<span class="red">只好先在安全处稳住身形。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "铁梯与碎石的回声">>
</div>


:: MP Region Blackiron Yard Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
给水塔下蹲着擦扳手的巡道老工，你上前打听场站深处动静。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-blackiron-yard-ask">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "上前搭话问路 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-yard-ask">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["blackiron_armored"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] to 1>>老工吐了口烟圈，朝东侧股道努嘴：<span class="green">告诉了你三号装甲货车的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_signal"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你信号塔值班室的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_platform"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你地下走私月台的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这儿的线索你都已经问透了。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	老工敲了敲铁轨让你别乱闯重地，<span class="red">摆摆手示意你别多管闲事。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link "扶灯罩套话 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-yard-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["blackiron_signal"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] to 1>>老工把灯罩挂回铁钩，脸色缓了些，压低声音透露：<span class="green">为你指明了信号塔值班室的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_platform"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了地下走私月台的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["blackiron_armored"]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_armored"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了三号装甲货车的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">说里头各处一切妥帖。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	老工警惕地收起扳手不再多话，<span class="red">严词告诫你莫要越界半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Blackiron Siding [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_siding"] to 1>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
