<<else>>
碎石道砟在脚下乱滚，你只顾站稳，没看清哪根拉杆被动过。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-blackiron-siding"></div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[查看黄铜风笛 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


