:: MP Region Blackiron Armored Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你凑近三号装甲车的铁枪架，保险箱铅封的位置只留着一圈新擦痕，暗格早已空了。车壁里还浮着淡淡的枪油味，百叶窗滤下的光落在积灰的地板上。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回车皮 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Armored]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Blackiron Armored Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你拉上装甲货车的铆钉钢门，坐在前段押运员隔间的帆布折叠床上歇息。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回三号装甲车 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Armored]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-blackiron-armored-rest-choices">
<<bedicon>><<link "拉掩铆钉钢门静坐 (0:10)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-armored-rest-choices">>
<<if $willpower gte 450 or $physique gte 12000>>
密不透风的厚钢板车厢将外界的动静彻底隔绝，<span class="green">结实的帆布床让你安心地恢复了不少体力。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
车底车轴间突然传来一阵老鼠抓挠铁网的刺耳声响，闷热的铁车厢也让你胸口发堵，<span class="red">怎么也静不下心。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "铁件与道砟的响动">>
<br>
<<mpeavesdropicon>><<link "揉松紧绷的手指 (0:06)">><<mpalert -5>><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-armored-rest-choices">>
你在结实的帆布折叠床上伸展手指，<span class="teal">厚钢板隔开了外面的寒风。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertloss "缩进车皮阴影">>
</div>


:: MP Region Blackiron Signal [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_signal"] to 1>>
高出地面两层的砖木信号楼内，十六根铸铁联锁拉杆一字排开。角落的老式摩尔斯电报机旁压着未裁断的纸带，四面玻璃窗可将整片调车场尽收眼底。
<<if $science gte 260 or $maths gte 260>>你扫了一眼联锁拉杆上的编号牌，迅速看懂了股道切换的指向。<<else>>密密麻麻的信号灯盘与拉杆让你不敢轻易触碰。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[蹲到联锁机箱前 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Signal Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[返回信号塔 (0:08)|MP Region Blackiron Signal Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"]>>
<<crimeicon "black box">><<link [[去走私月台 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "听纸带节奏 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-blackiron-signal">>
<<if $science gte 260 or $maths gte 260>>
你听出电报纸带重复着同一组短码，对照墙上的呼号表，它指向仓库地底的地下装卸台。
<<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>><br><<link [[去走私月台 (0:10)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<<else>>
继电器咔嗒乱响，你只听见一片没有间隔的噪声。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-blackiron-signal"></div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Blackiron Signal Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你拨开联锁机箱底层的挡板，配线槽里的锡盒盖歪着，只剩几截废电报纸带。楼下调车场一片安静，电报机偶尔自己敲出一两个没有意义的短音，你站着听了一会儿才动身。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回信号塔 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Signal]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回黑铁站 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Blackiron Signal Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你拉过值班室高脚木椅坐在窗边，居高临下地俯瞰整片寂静的调车场。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回信号塔 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Signal]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-blackiron-signal-rest-choices">
<<bedicon>><<link "俯瞰寂静站场放神 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-signal-rest-choices">>
<<if $willpower gte 440 or $athletics gte 260>>
开阔的视野让你不必担心有人从暗处靠近，木楼内温暖干燥，<span class="green">你靠在窗框边很快恢复了精神。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
窗外悬挑铁廊上的弧光探照灯罩被风吹得哐当作响，刺耳的噪音吵得你心烦意乱，<span class="red">根本无法静心休息。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link "喝口温水润湿喉咙 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-signal-rest-choices">>
你坐在干燥的信号楼窗边润了润嗓子，<span class="teal">开阔的视野让人心里格外踏实。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Blackiron Platform [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_platform"] to 1>>
隐藏在卸货仓库地底的秘密装卸月台直接连通着旧港暗渠，石砌边缘停着堆满樟木箱的手推平板车。铸铁水闸门后传来低沉的暗河水声。
<<if $skulduggery gte 300 or $athletics gte 280>>你借着立柱阴影遮掩身形，看清了起重滑轮与水闸的构造。<<else>>潮湿阴暗的地下月台里回荡着铁链撞击声，气氛紧绷。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 100>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<crimeicon "black box">><<link [[去走私月台 (0:14)|MP Region Blackiron Platform Search]]>><<pass 14>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfarmicon>><<link [[坐樟木货箱间养神 (0:08)|MP Region Blackiron Platform Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[探向盲段 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 1]]>><<mpalert 6>><<pass 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "踩着枕木摸进盲段暗影">>
<br>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 80>>
<<link "看滑轮配重 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-blackiron-platform">>
<<if $skulduggery gte 300 or $athletics gte 280>>
你发现配重铁箱的销轴上有一道新鲜黄油，箱盖边角还沾着樟木屑；旁边的水闸门半开着。
<<else>>
潮湿月台的回声把铁链声放大，你只看见滑轮在暗处轻轻晃。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-blackiron-platform"></div>
<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_blackiron_medal"]>><br><<keepsakeicon>><<link [[插入站长纪念铜章 (0:10)|MP Keepsake Use Medal]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><</if>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 80>>
<br>
<div id="mp-alert-blackiron-platform-exit">
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 100>>
<<link [[拼死一搏 (0:12)|MP Elite Encounter Blackiron Bosun]]>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "Blackiron Platform Return">><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpAlertCaught to 0>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Math.max(($seductionskill or 0), ($english or 0), ($willpower or 0)) gte 260>><<link [[虚张声势 (0:08)|MP Alert Blackiron Bluff]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[虚张声势 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "虚张声势">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[转身就跑 (0:06)|MP Alert Blackiron Flee]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[束手就擒 (0:08)|MP BadEnd Extra Blackiron Boxcar]]>><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[硬闯出去 (0:10)|MP Elite Encounter Blackiron Bosun]]>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "Blackiron Platform Return">><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpAlertCaught to 0>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Blackiron Platform Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你绕到起重滑轮后面，配重铁箱的盖板敞着，夹层里只剩一层樟木屑和半截浸潮的油纸。水闸门外暗河低沉地流淌，月台上再没有值得撬开的东西。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回月台 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Blackiron Platform Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "blackiron">><<mpalertinit "blackiron">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你挑了两只干燥的樟木货箱之间坐下，听着水闸外平缓的暗渠流水声。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回走私月台 (0:02)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-blackiron-platform-rest-choices">
<<bedicon>><<link "嗅着樟木清香调息 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-platform-rest-choices">>
<<if $willpower gte 460 or $skulduggery gte 280>>
淡淡的樟木清香掩去了地底的潮气，隐蔽的货箱死角让你安心地缓过劲来，<span class="green">体力恢复了不少。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
水闸门的铜钟被暗浪冲得叮当乱响，像是有暗哨正在靠近，<span class="red">吓得你立刻绷紧身体站了起来。</span>
<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "扎紧松脱的鞋带 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-blackiron-platform-rest-choices">>
你蹲在樟木货箱旁重新系紧鞋带，<span class="teal">淡淡的木香掩去了水闸的潮气。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Druid Circle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_pillars"] to 1>>
穿过古木参天的深林迷雾，高大的风化花岗岩石柱在林间空地上围成一圈。苍翠的苔藓覆盖着脚下的腐殖土，空气中弥漫着清冽的松脂气息。
<<if $tending gte 260 or $willpower gte 450>>你顺着石柱上的螺旋符文辨清了林间方位。<<else>>浓重的林雾在巨石间流转，让人很难看清石环外围的去路。<</if>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>林冠间漏下清冷的星辉，石柱凹槽里的湿苔泛着极淡的银绿微光。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:14)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 14>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsmokeicon>><<link [[去迷雾石柱 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[辨认林间兽径 (0:06)|MP Region Druid Circle Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[问巡林猎手 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Circle Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpMicroNotice and $mpMicroNotice["druid_conduit"]>>
	<<mpherbicon>><<link [[清松脂块 (0:04)|MP Region Micro Druid Conduit]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Druid">><<link [[巡看石环四周 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Druid]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Druid Circle Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你拨开低垂的槲寄生，顺着石柱底座星辰刻痕与兽径搜寻。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深林石环 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-druid-circle-scout">
<<crimeicon "mark">><<link "摸刻痕 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-circle-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>你循着苔藓下的石板路往前探去，<span class="green">发现了通往月泉祭坛的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往古根地穴的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往守林人瞭望台的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你把四周通路细细看了一遍，<span class="teal">眼下各处风平浪静。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	荆棘勾破了你的衣角与手背，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link "攀上古橡树枝干 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-circle-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>>你攀上高枝透过浓雾看清了林间方位，<span class="green">锁定了守林人瞭望台的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了古根地穴的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了月泉祭坛的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">往来路径早已成竹在胸。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	湿滑树皮让你脚下一滑差点摔落，<span class="red">不敢在毫无准备下硬闯。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Druid Circle Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
树根石台边坐着包扎猎犬的巡林猎手，你上前请教石环四周路径。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深林石环 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-druid-circle-ask">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "开口问路径 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-circle-ask">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>>猎手安抚好猎犬，抬手指了指雾中：<span class="green">告诉了你月泉祭坛的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你古根地穴的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你守林人瞭望台的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说此处的来龙去脉你已尽数知悉。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	猎犬冲你低吠，猎手劝你趁早出林，<span class="red">把话头堵得死死的。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<crimeicon "mark">><<link "指认林间猎道记号 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-circle-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["druid_rootcave"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>>猎手见你认得阿什的巡山记号，点头告知：<span class="green">为你指明了古根地穴的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_watchtower"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_watchtower"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了守林人瞭望台的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了月泉祭坛的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">说内部没有异样动静。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你认错了记号，猎手冷淡地摇了摇头，<span class="red">只准你在外廊附近活动。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Druid Pillars [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["druid_pillars"] to 1>>
十二根高耸的风化花岗岩石柱在林间围成环阵，凹槽里的螺旋古符文在雨雾中泛着温润微光。两座主石柱之间拉着编满干枯槲寄生的麻绳。
<<if $history gte 260 or $tending gte 260>>你看出石柱排列暗合冬至月相的方位。<<else>>高大的巨石阵在浓雾里投下沉重的阴影。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深林石环 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[垫脚够主石柱 (0:10)|MP Region Druid Pillars Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[返回迷雾石柱 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Pillars Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"]>>
<<mpritualicon>><<link [[去月泉祭坛 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Moonwell]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "看石柱影线 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-druid-pillars">>
<<if $history gte 260 or $tending gte 260>>
你发现正午影线落在两根挂槲寄生的石柱之间，影尖所指的浅草下有一条被踩实的引水小径。
<<set $mpKnown["druid_moonwell"] to 1>><br><<link [[去月泉祭坛 (0:05)|MP Region Druid Moonwell]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>>
林雾把石柱的影子揉成一团，你看了半天也定不准方向。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-druid-pillars"></div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[扶起枯枝 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Druid Pillars Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
