<<caveicon "torch">><<link [[去古根地穴 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "看泉眼水纹 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-druid-moonwell">>
<<if $tending gte 280 or $purity gte 500>>
你发现泉眼有一缕细流绕过白石池沿，渗向东南那棵古橡树的根须；树根下有一道被水冲亮的缝。
<<set $mpKnown["druid_rootcave"] to 1>><br><<link [[去古根地穴 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
