<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[返回林冠瞭望台 (0:08)|MP Region Druid Watchtower Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[下到树心穴 (0:08)|MP Extra Deep Druid 1]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "看鸽笼方向 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-druid-watchtower">>
<<if $athletics gte 280 or $tending gte 260>>
你看见信鸽总朝西南一片林隙盘旋，那里有一缕极细的炊烟；笼底还卡着一小截磨断的皮绳。
<<else>>
山风把鸽笼吹得乱晃，你只看见灰鸽扑腾，没辨出它们的方向。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-druid-watchtower"></div>


:: MP Region Druid Watchtower Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你握住瞭望台顶层望远镜架的底座，顺着木纹接缝拧动空心立柱的暗盖。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回林冠瞭望台 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="druid-watchtower-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "旋空心木柱 (0:11)">><<pass 11>><<replace "#druid-watchtower-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Druid_Watchtower")>>
		木柱暗盖旋开，你取出一卷深林秘道图、一只古董银鹰哨和一朵银丝花标本；筒底压着一枚巡林银币。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
		<<if ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragBrideFlower to ($mpFragBrideFlower or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_druid_watchtower>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_druid_watchtower to 1>>
			你在中层值班室柴火堆后的饼干盒里翻出两枚备用银币和一张标着「西南林隙」的草图。<span class="green">你将柴火堆后饼干盒里的备用银币与草图妥善收进贴身衣袋。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">柴火堆后的饼干盒今日已被你翻过，只余下几粒干松子壳。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	劲风吹晃树冠，木柱上的倒刺扎进掌心，信鸽笼里的灰鸽扑腾乱叫。你连忙缩手扶稳栏杆。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsewicon>><<link "扫视林线 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#druid-watchtower-choices">>
<<if $athletics gte 280 or $science gte 240>>
	你从镜筒里扫到西南林隙有一处新踩出的岔路，路旁插着一根系白布的木桩。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	镜片起了雾，你擦了几次仍看不清远处。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Druid Watchtower Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你退进瞭望台中层挂着狼皮的值班室，靠着干燥的松木壁板坐下歇息。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回林冠瞭望台 (0:02)|MP Region Druid Watchtower]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-druid-watchtower-rest-choices">
<<bedicon>><<link "裹紧狼皮软垫挡风 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-watchtower-rest-choices">>
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $willpower gte 450>>
高出林冠的清爽山风吹散了满身闷热，松木壁板挡住了寒流，<span class="green">胸中的郁结一扫而空。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
狂风吹得整座木瞭望台咯吱摇晃，百叶窗框啪啪拍打着木墙，晃得你头晕眼花，<span class="red">半刻也坐不住。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link "活动发酸手腕 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-druid-watchtower-rest-choices">>
你靠在松木壁板上甩了甩攀爬发酸的手腕，<span class="teal">林冠清风吹散了胸中闷气。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Velvet Mirage [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_masque"] to 1>>
步入悬崖廊柱下的天鹅绒侧门，一条铺着暗红波斯地毯的隐秘沙龙沿着峭壁内侧延伸开来。水晶壁灯洒下暖昧的柔光，空气中浮动着白麝香与香槟的气息。
<<if $danceskill gte 260 or $beauty gte 3500>>你从容地调整呼吸，步伐优雅地融入了廊间的暗影。<<else>>华美帷幔后隐约传来的低笑声让你心跳不由得快了几拍。<</if>>
<<if ($exposed or 0) gte 1>>微凉的穿堂风掠过你裸露的皮肤，你在丝绒帷幔的掩映下不由得加快了脚步。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 100>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回康努达图斯街 (0:08)|Connudatus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><<set $mpAlertArea to "">><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回假面回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Masque]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[留意帷幔暗门 (0:06)|MP Region Velvet Mirage Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<cosmeticsicon>><<link [[问假面侍者 (0:05)|MP Region Velvet Mirage Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) lt 80>>
<<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Velvet">><<link [[巡看前厅四周 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Velvet]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 80>>
<br>
<div id="mp-alert-velvet-exit">
<<if ($mpAlert or 0) gte 100>>
<<link [[拼死一搏 (0:12)|MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers]]>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "Velvet Alert Return">><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpAlertCaught to 0>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<if Math.max(($seductionskill or 0), ($english or 0), ($willpower or 0)) gte 260>><<link [[虚张声势 (0:08)|MP Alert Velvet Bluff]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><<else>><<link [[虚张声势 (0:08)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "虚张声势">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 意志等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link [[转身就跑 (0:06)|MP Alert Velvet Flee]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[束手就擒 (0:08)|MP BadEnd Velvet Doll]]>><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpBadEndProgress to 0>><<set $mpBadEndDays to 1>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link [[硬闯出去 (0:10)|MP Elite Encounter Velvet Enforcers]]>><<set $mpReturnPassage to "Velvet Alert Return">><<set $mpAlert to 0>><<set $mpAlertCaught to 0>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<</if>>
</div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Velvet Mirage Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你停在廊柱阴影里，留心观察侍者端盘出入的丝绒帷幔。
