<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:02)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-velvet-mirage-scout">
<<investigateicon>><<link "闪入帷幔后查探 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-velvet-mirage-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["velvet_salon"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] to 1>>你顺着地毯暗纹摸清了内室方向，<span class="green">发现了通往镜面试衣沙龙的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_terrace"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往露台观海雅座的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_auction"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_auction"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往私人拍卖暗厅的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你沿着边角小径巡视了一圈，<span class="teal">没有找到新的痕迹。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	高跟鞋声逼近，你被门槛绊了一下，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link "窥探内廊 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-velvet-mirage-scout">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["velvet_auction"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_auction"] to 1>>你借斜角铜镜看清了执事守卫的暗门，<span class="green">锁定了私人拍卖暗厅的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_terrace"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了露台观海雅座的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_salon"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了镜面试衣沙龙的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">四周的岔路方位已分毫不差。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	铜镜角度偏了半寸，执事的影子从镜里掠过，<span class="red">你只得缩回帷幔后。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
</div>


:: MP Region Velvet Mirage Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
香槟推车旁立着戴银羽半面具的侍者，你上前打听内厅门道。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:02)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
