<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["velvet_salon"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] to 1>>侍者微微躬身，朝丝绒长廊示意：<span class="green">告诉了你镜面试衣沙龙的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_terrace"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你露台观海雅座的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_auction"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_auction"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你私人拍卖暗厅的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说这地方再没什么能瞒过你了。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	侍者礼貌却坚决地拦下了你的话头，<span class="red">警惕地收起东西不再理你。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<windowicon>><<link "亮出暗层贵宾切口 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-velvet-mirage-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["velvet_terrace"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>>侍者听出暗层切口，低声为你引路：<span class="green">为你指明了露台观海雅座的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_auction"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_auction"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了私人拍卖暗厅的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["velvet_salon"]>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了镜面试衣沙龙的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">说里头还是老样子。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你说漏了半句行话，侍者微笑不语，<span class="red">让你赶紧原路退回去。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Velvet Masque [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_masque"] to 1>>
长廊两侧的暗红壁龛里陈列着十二副威尼斯金银雕花假面，往来宾客皆以面具遮面。远处隐约传来大提琴低柔的弦音，胡桃木衣帽架立在回廊尽头。
<<if $danceskill gte 260 or $seductionskill gte 260>>你踏着弦乐节拍从容走过壁龛，姿态没有露出丝毫破绽。<<else>>银狐假面空洞的眼眶在壁灯下闪着微光，令人有些紧张。<</if>>
