<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[走近银狐壁龛 (0:09)|MP Region Velvet Masque Search]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
