<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertloss "躲进帷幔阴影">>
</div>


:: MP Region Velvet Salon [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["velvet_salon"] to 1>>
四壁镶嵌着斜角落地铜镜的私密沙龙内，衣架上挂满了高定丝绸与蕾丝礼裙。正中央的旋转试衣台铺着天鹅绒毯，梳妆台上摆着一排紫水晶香水瓶。
<<if $beauty gte 3500 or $danceskill gte 260>>你走过落地铜镜前，借着多角度的镜面将四周动静尽收眼底。<<else>>重重叠叠的镜面映出无数道身影，让人有些分不清方向。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天鹅绒厅 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<mptailoricon>><<link [[蹲到试衣台边 (0:11)|MP Region Velvet Salon Search]]>><<pass 11>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[靠屏风贵妃榻养神 (0:08)|MP Region Velvet Salon Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"]>>
<<windowicon>><<link [[去观海露台 (0:07)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "看镜面角度 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-velvet-salon">>
<<if $beauty gte 3500 or $danceskill gte 260>>
你借斜角铜镜看见西侧纱帘后有一道通往露台的门，门边地毯被反复踩出一道浅痕。
<<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>><br><<link [[去观海露台 (0:07)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
重重镜面映出无数道身影，你看得有些分不清方向。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-velvet-salon"></div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Velvet Salon Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你蹲在旋转试衣台边缘，顺着天鹅绒包边的接缝摸索底座暗抽屉的锁扣。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回试衣沙龙 (0:02)|MP Region Velvet Salon]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="velvet-salon-choices">
<<mptailoricon>><<link "摸试衣台底 (0:11)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 11>><<replace "#velvet-salon-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Velvet_Salon")>>
		暗抽屉无声滑开，你取出一匣名贵珍珠饰品和一枚暗金假面徽章；首饰盒底层还有约 <span class="gold">£3</span> 的制衣定金。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
		<<if ($mpFragVelvetCrest or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragVelvetCrest to ($mpFragVelvetCrest or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money 300>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_velvet_salon>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_velvet_salon to 1>>
			你在三折屏风后的红珊瑚手包夹层里找出两枚金镑硬币和一张写着「露台雅座」的请柬。<span class="green">你将红珊瑚手包夹层里的金镑与露台请柬妥善收进贴身衣袋。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">三折屏风后的手包夹层今日已被你翻过，只余下一缕脂粉香。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	裁缝人台腰封上的珠针扎破指尖，旋转台底座也发出一声闷响。你连忙缩手站起。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
<br>
<<mpfirstaidicon>><<link "查衣架尺码牌 (0:06)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 6>><<replace "#velvet-salon-choices">>
<<if $housekeeping gte 250 or $beauty gte 3500>>
	<<set $mpKnown["velvet_terrace"] to 1>>
	你在一件披风的尺码牌后找到一张露台邀请卡，卡角印着观海雅座的藤椅纹样。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	香水味太冲，你翻了几个衣架便觉得头晕。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
</div>


