			你在后台记账桌的象牙算盘下摸出两枚保证金银币和一张写着买家缩写的底价单。<span class="green">你将象牙算盘下的保证金银币与底价单妥善收进贴身衣袋。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">记账桌象牙算盘下今日已被你翻过，只余下几滴干涸红蜡。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	展台下的配重铜铃突然被碰响，后台走廊传来执事询问的脚步声。你慌忙放下罩布退入暗影。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link "翻后台记账桌 (0:07)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 7>><<replace "#velvet-auction-choices">>
<<if $maths gte 240 or $history gte 240>>
	你在账册夹页里找到一个买家的缩写和一枚火漆印，印面和壁龛里的假面徽章一模一样。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	算盘珠散了一地，你只顾去捡，没看清账页上的字。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
</div>


:: MP Region Velvet Auction Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if ($mpAlertArea or "") isnot "velvet">><<mpalertinit "velvet">><</if>><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你走上拍卖暗厅二楼的贵宾包厢，拉拢双层金线纱帘，坐进宽大的真皮沙发里。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回拍卖暗厅 (0:02)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-velvet-auction-rest-choices">
<<bedicon>><<link "拉拢双层金纱静坐 (0:10)">><<mpalert 8>><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-velvet-auction-rest-choices">>
<<if $willpower gte 470 or $control gte 300>>
厚重的金线纱帘将你的行踪完全隐匿，<span class="green">静谧奢华的包厢让你紧绷的身心彻底放松下来。</span>
<<tiredness -5>><<stress -6>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
壁柱后方的黄铜传菜梯突然发出一阵刺耳的滑轮摩擦声，惊得你从沙发上弹坐起来，<span class="red">心脏砰砰直跳。</span>
<<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertgain "帷幔后的细响">>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link "揉按发沉的太阳穴 (0:06)">><<mpalert -5>><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-velvet-auction-rest-choices">>
你在金线纱帘后的真皮沙发上揉了揉太阳穴，<span class="teal">幽静的环境令你精神一振。</span>
<<tiredness -3>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<</replace>><</link>><<mpalertloss "躲进帷幔阴影">>
</div>


:: MP Region Observatory Wing [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_dome"] to 1>>
穿过图书馆古籍架后的木制暗门，你踏入了学园早年封存的旧天文翼楼。半球形木拱廊下陈列着落满灰尘的黄铜浑天仪，空气中弥漫着樟木与旧书卷的气息。
<<if $science gte 260 or $maths gte 260>>你借着高窗透入的微光看清了廊柱上的导览铜牌。<<else>>封存多年的旧翼楼空旷幽静，每走一步木地板都会发出轻响。<</if>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨点敲打着高处的弧形采光天窗，将整座旧翼楼衬得愈发幽深。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学院图书馆 (0:08)|School Library]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpastroicon>><<link [[去折光穹顶 (0:05)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[查看旋梯痕迹 (0:06)|MP Region Observatory Wing Scout]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[问值日学长 (0:05)|MP Region Observatory Wing Ask]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_observatory_lens"]>><<link [[旋入古透镜 (0:08)|MP Keepsake Use Lens]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br><</if>><<set $mpCurrentRegion to "Observatory">><<link [[巡看翼楼四周 (0:05)|MP Region Pool Observatory]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>


:: MP Region Observatory Wing Scout [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你凑到走廊黄铜平面图前，拂去浮灰辨认旧翼楼各处通道。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-observatory-wing-scout">
<<investigateicon>><<link "探查绒布帘后暗门 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-wing-scout">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["observatory_star"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>>你在书架夹缝后摸到了铜门把手，<span class="green">发现了通往星图档案室的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往标本陈列暗阁的路径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>><span class="green">发现了通往钟楼连廊的路径。</span>
	<<else>>你把周围通道清查了一遍，<span class="teal">周围各处安稳如初。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	落灰呛得你打了个喷嚏，<span class="red">只能先行退回。</span><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><<gstress>><<gpain>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link "攀铁梯探看 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-wing-scout">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11500>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>你登上铁梯半层看清了拱廊走向，<span class="green">锁定了钟楼连廊的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了标本陈列暗阁的入口。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_star"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>><span class="green">锁定了星图档案室的入口。</span>
	<<else>>高处视野开阔，<span class="teal">底下的街巷与暗径已尽数摸清。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	旧铁梯发出吱呀长鸣惊动了值日生，<span class="red">只得先退回外围观察。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Observatory Wing Ask [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
暗门连廊旁站着核对编号的值日图书员，你上前询问旧翼楼分布。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-observatory-wing-ask">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "轻声询问翼楼格局 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-wing-ask">>
<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4200>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["observatory_star"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>>图书员推了推眼镜，指了指走廊内侧：<span class="green">告诉了你星图档案室的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你标本陈列暗阁的走法。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>><span class="green">告诉了你钟楼连廊的走法。</span>
	<<else>>对方笑了笑，<span class="teal">说周围的暗记你早已了然于心。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	图书员合上登记簿让你别往封存区走，<span class="red">半句口风都不肯漏给你。</span><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpastroicon>><<link "提起星图检索编号 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-wing-ask">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<if !$mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>>图书员见你熟悉旧档编号，小声告知：<span class="green">为你指明了标本陈列暗阁的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了钟楼连廊的暗径。</span><<elseif !$mpKnown["observatory_star"]>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>><span class="green">为你指明了星图档案室的暗径。</span>
	<<else>>对方冲你点点头，<span class="teal">告知你里面今日并无变故。</span><</if>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你报出的索引号不对，图书员摇了摇头，<span class="red">警告你别往深处乱闯。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Observatory Dome [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_dome"] to 1>>
可以开启天窗的半球形主厅中央，架设着一具巨型黄铜赤道仪与折光望远镜。地面铺着环形旋转滑轨，目镜下方放着厚重的观测记录簿。
<<if $science gte 280 or $maths gte 280>>你一眼看懂了赤道仪配重箱与赤纬刻度盘的平衡结构。<<else>>庞大的黄铜望远镜直指穹顶天窗，透着精密而森严的气息。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[走到赤道仪北侧 (0:10)|MP Region Observatory Dome Search]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Dome Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_star"]>>
<<mpastroicon>><<link [[返回星图档案室 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "看赤道仪配重 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-observatory-dome">>
<<if $science gte 280 or $maths gte 280>>
你发现配重铁匣比旁边的黄铜砝码轻了一截，匣底滑轨上有一道常被拉开的亮痕，正对着星图档案室。
<<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>><br><<link [[返回星图档案室 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
巨大的黄铜望远镜投下阴影，你只看见配重匣在暗处一动不动。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-observatory-dome"></div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[查看滑轨断齿铜轮 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Observatory Dome Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你走到巨型赤道仪北侧的配重铁匣旁，伸手拨动侧面松脱的黄铜锁扣。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="observatory-dome-choices">
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link "拨配重匣锁扣 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#observatory-dome-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 330>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Observatory_Dome")>>
		你顺利打开配重匣，取出一枚消色差古透镜和半枚王冠黄铜齿轮；铜版星图下还压着一张社团经费单。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
		<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_dome>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_dome to 1>>
			你在环形步道小铁桌的火漆盒下摸出两枚学长遗落的银币和一张写着「1894 号筒」的纸条。<span class="green">你将小铁桌火漆盒下的银币与编号纸条妥善收进贴身衣袋。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">小铁桌火漆盒下今日已被你查过，只剩几块碎火漆片。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	地面旋转滑轨里的铜配件卡住鞋底，膝盖磕在赤道仪铁架上。你疼得倒吸一口凉气。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link "读观测记录簿 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#observatory-dome-choices">>
<<if $science gte 280 or $maths gte 280>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_star"] to 1>>
	你翻到一页夜间观测记录，末行写着「1894 号筒已移入星图室」，旁边画着一个小箭头。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	记录簿被天窗漏下的水汽泡皱，你只认出几个日期。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


:: MP Region Observatory Dome Rest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你登上穹顶室高挑的皮垫观测椅坐稳，透过天窗玻璃仰望高处的云影。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回折光穹顶 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="mp-region-observatory-dome-rest-choices">
<<bedicon>><<link "仰望天窗云影放神 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#mp-region-observatory-dome-rest-choices">>
<<if $science gte 250 or $willpower gte 440>>
开阔安静的半球形厅堂隔绝了教学楼的嘈杂，<span class="green">平稳的呼吸让你满身压力消减了大半。</span>
<<tiredness -4>><<stress -5>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
天窗缝隙漏进来的穿堂冷风吹得望远镜铜筒嗡嗡轻颤，高脚椅摇晃不止，<span class="red">让你始终无法安心合眼。</span>
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
