<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[踩上木踏脚凳 (0:12)|MP Region Observatory Star Search]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[靠樟木画筒架小憩 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Star Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"]>>
<<farmicon "lab">><<link [[去标本陈列阁 (0:07)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "看画筒编号 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-observatory-star">>
<<if $history gte 280 or $maths gte 260>>
你发现画筒架在 1893 与 1895 之间空出一格，空档后方的墙板上有一道新擦痕，通向标本陈列阁。
<<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>><br><<link [[去标本陈列阁 (0:07)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet]]>><<pass 7>><</link>>
<<else>>
成百上千只铜管在暗处泛着同样的光，你看得眼花。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-observatory-star"></div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[查看铜地球仪 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>


:: MP Region Observatory Star Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你踩上木踏脚凳，伸手去拧画筒架最底层『1894』号黄铜画筒的螺纹封盖。
<br><br>
<<mpastroicon>><<link [[返回星图档案室 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="observatory-star-choices">
<<mprepairicon>><<link "拧画筒封盖 (0:12)">><<pass 12>><<replace "#observatory-star-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 360>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Observatory_Star")>>
		封盖顺畅旋开，你倒出一卷孤儿院早年星象密档和半枚王冠齿轮残片；筒底绒布包里还有约 <span class="gold">£3</span> 的档案保管金。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
		<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money 300>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_star>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_star to 1>>
			你在地球仪支架下的皮面笔记本夹层里翻出两枚旧书券和一张标着「陈列阁」的索书条。<span class="green">你将皮面笔记本夹层里的旧书券与索书条妥善收进贴身衣袋。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">地球仪下的笔记本夹层今日已被你翻过，只余下旧纸气息。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	画筒封盖锈得极死，上方架子一只空铜筒滚落下来砸在额角。你捂着额头退下踏脚凳。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<crimeicon "safe">><<link "查月相蚀变图 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#observatory-star-choices">>
<<if $history gte 280 or $maths gte 260>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>>
	你从月相蚀变图的边缘读出一组日期，和标本陈列阁门牌上的收藏年份完全吻合。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	图纸受潮起皱，你算到一半便对不上刻度。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


