:: MP Region Observatory Cabinet [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_cabinet"] to 1>>
内侧暗阁的玻璃展柜里陈列着早期自然科学标本、紫水晶簇与光学棱镜。东壁挂着一幅古生物化石石板，夜光萤石在暗处散发出柔和的浅绿微光。
<<if $science gte 280 or $history gte 260>>你注意到最底层紫水晶簇的木底座留有合页缝隙。<<else>>形态各异的化石与矿石晶簇在幽暗中显得格外冷峻。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[蹲到最底层展柜 (0:11)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet Search]]>><<pass 11>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[坐萤石展柜旁养神 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"]>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去钟楼连廊 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Bridge]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "看底座合页 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-observatory-cabinet">>
<<if $science gte 280 or $history gte 260>>
你注意到紫水晶簇的木底座有一道合页缝，旁边地面有一串从钟楼连廊方向来的新鲜鞋印。
<<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>><br><<link [[去钟楼连廊 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Bridge]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
萤石绿光把展柜照得冷幽幽的，你只看见一片晶簇的反光。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-observatory-cabinet"></div>
<</if>>


:: MP Region Observatory Cabinet Search [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
你蹲在玻璃展柜最底层，用铜镊子去拨紫水晶簇空心底座的内侧卡簧。
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回标本陈列阁 (0:02)|MP Region Observatory Cabinet]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="observatory-cabinet-choices">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨水晶底座 (0:11)">><<pass 11>><<replace "#observatory-cabinet-choices">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 370>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>
	<<if currentSkillValue("skulduggery") gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("region_unique_MP_Region_Observatory_Cabinet")>>
		底座暗格弹开，你翻出一枚旧港走私王火漆印戒、一块古矿石标本和半枚王冠齿轮残片；里面还垫着一枚收藏金币。
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
		<<if ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) lt 3>><<set $mpFragCrownGear to ($mpFragCrownGear or 0) + 1>><</if>>
		<<money 400>>
		<<stress -3>>
	<<else>>
		<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
		<<if !$daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_cabinet>>
			<<set $daily.mpRegionLoot_observatory_cabinet to 1>>
			你在旋转玻璃架的海螺化石螺口里摸出两枚绒布包裹的旧银币和一张写着「钟楼连廊」的标签。<span class="green">你将海螺化石里的旧银币与连廊标签妥善收进贴身衣袋。</span>
			<<stress -2>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="teal">海螺化石螺口今日已被你探过，只剩一层细微的钙质白粉。</span>
			<<stress -1>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	锋利的水晶棱角划破指腹，镊子也在玻璃柜壁上磕出脆响。你连忙缩手合上柜门。
	<<stress 5>><<pain 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<farmicon "lab">><<link "查化石石板铭牌 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#observatory-cabinet-choices">>
<<if $science gte 280 or $history gte 260>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>
	你读出一块化石石板的捐赠铭牌，末尾提到「钟楼连廊风速计」，字迹和展柜标签同源。
	<<stress -1>>
<<else>>
	铭牌被地衣糊住，你只认出半个姓氏。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 3>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>


