:: MP Region Observatory Bridge [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpKnown["observatory_bridge"] to 1>>
架设在屋顶飞扶壁之间的石砌拱廊装有防风百叶窗，透过拱券可直接眺望近在咫尺的学园钟塔。西侧壁龛里立着一座铜制风速计，风杯缓缓旋转。
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $willpower gte 450>>你稳步走在宽阔的拱窗石台边，俯瞰整座学园的青石屋顶。<<else>>高处穿堂而过的风声在飞扶壁间呼啸，让人有些心悸。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[探身靠近石兽 (0:11)|MP Region Observatory Bridge Search]]>><<pass 11>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[返回钟楼连廊 (0:08)|MP Region Observatory Bridge Rest]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link "看风速计轴承 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#obs-observatory-bridge">>
<<if $athletics gte 260 or $science gte 240>>
你发现风速计轴承上油过多，旁边石兽背部有一道被反复摸过的浅槽，槽里卡着一小片铁皮。
<<else>>
高处风声呼啸，你只顾扶稳石栏，没细看风速计。
<<tiredness 1>><<stress 2>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="obs-observatory-bridge"></div>


